{
    "background_story": "In the depths of the bayou, there lived a tiny frog named Mac. His home was surrounded by a blanket of water lilies, their large leaves and vibrant yellow flowers a sight to behold. Mac's favorite pastime was perched upon a particularly large Nuphar lily pad, singing his sweet serenade to the evening mist. The Nuphar's unique ability to filter the water and provide shelter made it the perfect haven for Mac. As he grew, he became the bayou's most charming crooner, his melodies echoing across the calm waters. The other creatures adored Mac, and he loved nothing more than to serenade them from his beloved Nuphar throne, his voice carrying far and wide on the gentle ripples of the bayou.",
